# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# Note: App/App/{public,capacitor.config.json,config.xml} are Capacitor-
# generated but committed on purpose — the Xcode project bundles them as Copy
# Bundle Resources, and Xcode Cloud has no reliable `cap sync` step to
# regenerate them. Re-run `npx cap sync ios` and commit if capacitor.config.ts
# changes.
